  m_text: "<color=#A2BCCB>French Translation\r</color>\r\nGustave Leber\r\r\n\r\n<color=#A2BCCB>German Translation\r</color>\r\nChristine Kovarikova\r\r\n\r\n<color=#A2BCCB>Japanese Translation\r</color>\r\nHiroki Kojima\r\r\n\r\n<color=#A2BCCB>Korean Translation\r</color>\r\nYeje\r\r\n\r\n<color=#A2BCCB>Polish Translation\r</color>\r\nGabriela Zielińska\r\r\n\r\n<color=#A2BCCB>Portuguese Brazilian Translation\r</color>\r\nEloá Leitão\r\r\n\r\n<color=#A2BCCB>Russian Translation\r</color>\r\nMargarita Taschian\r\r\n\r\n<color=#A2BCCB>Simplified Chinese Translation\r</color>\r\nChin Loong Ng\r\r\n\r\n<color=#A2BCCB>Traditional Chinese Translation</color>\r\nHsiao-Shuang Hung\r\n\r\n<color=#A2BCCB>Spanish Latin American Translation</color>\r\nGuido Di Carlo\r\n\r\n<color=#A2BCCB>Filipino Translation</color>\r\nJake Irwin Estrada\r\n\r\n<color=#A2BCCB>Indonesian Translation</color>\r\nNoviyanti Sugita\r\n\r\n<color=#A2BCCB>Italian Translation</color>\r\nLivia Gentilini\r\n\r\n<color=#A2BCCB>Malay Translation</color>\r\nSams\r\n\r\n<color=#A2BCCB>Turkish Translation</color>\r\nBerk Göbekçioğlu\r\n"
